# Copy this file to _sync/.env and fill in the values from your browser.
#
# How to get them (Chrome/Edge):
#   1. Sign in at https://leetcode.com
#   2. F12 -> Application -> Storage -> Cookies -> https://leetcode.com
#   3. Copy the *Value* column for the two cookies below.
#
# LEETCODE_SESSION is a login token: treat it like a password. It lives only in
# _sync/.env, which is gitignored. It expires every couple of weeks - when the
# sync reports an auth error, paste in a fresh one.

LEETCODE_SESSION=
LEETCODE_CSRF_TOKEN=
